4,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think we should check if the gallery can actually handle the exhibits. I'm worried about the building's limits.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree we need data. However, we should prioritize what actually brings people back, not just what looks good on a proposal.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,But who is going to do all the work? I feel like the grown-ups forget that people get tired! We need to check the staff!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm worried about the stuff not arriving on time! We always apologize to visitors when things are missing. Let's see where we messed up before!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A fascinating array of concerns. Perhaps we could also uncover where our budget vanishes so mysteriously each season? It would be a shame to be surprised by the invoices again.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Benjamin... is the budget more important than the floor? I just... I don't want something to break.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Both are valid, but neither tells us if the public actually enjoyed the experience. We need to look at the records of the visitors.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, the visitors won't be happy if the staff are too grumpy because they're working too hard! Let's look at the rosters!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that's true! But if the art isn't even here, the staff have nothing to do! We have to fix the delivery problems first!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Let us not be hasty. A balanced approach is best. If we understand the hidden costs and the structural limits, we can avoid a financial catastrophe.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll look into the building's structure then. I just want to be safe.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will focus on the visitor feedback. The numbers on paper often lie about the actual impact of an exhibition.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going to find out who is actually working! I bet the list is super old and wrong!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm going to dig into the paperwork and the shipping! I want to know why things get stuck!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall investigate the maintenance logs and the transport costs. I suspect the ""small"" details are where our money goes to hide.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
