35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I found out that the bay has a strict weight limit. And the evening events... they might damage things.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"It seems that static displays are failing us. People are not returning for ""perfect"" exhibits; they want interaction and human presence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,This is just as I thought! The lab is almost empty and the volunteers are too busy with other things! We can't pick a hard project!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,I found out that we keep missing the shipping cut-offs! It's not the trucks; it's the paperwork that's too slow! We need something simple to ship!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"How illuminating. It appears our ""modern"" displays are quite temperamental, and our transport costs are... let's call them ""enthusiastic.""","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Kenji... if the paperwork is slow, maybe we should pick something that doesn't need a lot of shipping?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, that's a practical point. But we must ensure the chosen candidate provides a dynamic experience, or we'll see the same drop in attendance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, we can't do ""dynamic"" if there's only one person in the lab! They'll have a meltdown! We need a candidate that doesn't need much fixing!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! If we pick a candidate with a hundred different lenders, we're just asking for another season of saying ""Sorry, it's not here yet!""","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I must agree with Rin. The maintenance logs suggest that powered displays are a liability, both for the budget and the visitor experience.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm really worried about the weight... if the candidate has heavy sculptures, the floor might not take it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We should look for a candidate that balances a low logistical burden with a high potential for visitor engagement.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I just want to make sure the people working here can actually sleep at night! No more ""two roles for one person"" please!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,Let's avoid anything with a huge list of international loans. Local stuff is way safer for the schedule!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Logic dictates we avoid any proposal requiring complex electronics or excessive shipping. Let us prioritize stability over spectacle.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
