60,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I think... Candidate A is the safest. It's local, and textiles aren't heavy. They won't hurt the floor.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Candidate A and C both offer the human element I'm looking for. The demonstration sessions and the conservation bench would encourage repeat visits.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"No way to Candidate C! A ""working conservation bench"" means the one person in the lab has to work while people stare at them! That's too much!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I love Candidate A! Local stuff means no shipping cut-off nightmares! No more apologizing at the door!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Candidate D is a financial and logistical nightmare waiting to happen. Rigging and electronics? I can already hear the invoices screaming.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Rin... I agree about the stress. Candidate A seems... quiet. It wouldn't be too hard on the building or the people.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,Candidate A is the most logical choice. It satisfies the need for visitor engagement through the craftspeople without the risks of Candidate D.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I like Candidate A! The craftspeople can help out, so the museum staff don't have to do everything themselves!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Kenji,,It's perfect! Local loans are easy to track. We can actually get everything in the gallery before the opening day!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,It is rare that we all agree so quickly. Candidate A avoids the transport traps and the maintenance pitfalls. It is the only rational choice.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I feel... a bit better about this. I think A is the right one.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It is the only one that aligns with the historical data of what the public actually values.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! Let's pick the one that doesn't make the staff cry!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm so happy! No more shipping disasters!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,A triumph of pragmatism over ambition. I shall cast my vote for A.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
